Package: rom-hamster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: ROM library manager (command line)
 Import, classify and query a local ROM library kept in a single SQLite file.
 The command line front end is fully scriptable and runs without a display.
 .
 This package contains the CLI, the shared core library and the man page.

Package: rom-hamster-data
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: platform rules for rom-hamster
 Factory defaults for rom-hamster: platform rule table, front-end templates and
 the configuration template. Files here are read only.

